<title>USA: Mesquite, Texas, $3 mln, won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Mesquite, Texas, $3 mln, won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $3.6 million of Mesquite, Texas, waterworks and sewer revenue bonds, series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.43 percent.</p>
